Error [E0205]: cannot edit `n` — `c` does not have the write-capability marker `&`
  --> tests/ui/param_field_write_needs_write.jet:6:7
    |
  6 |     c.n += 1
    |       ^
 Why: editing a field requires the write-capability marker `&` on the owning place
 Fix: mark the parameter with the write-capability marker `&`: `c: &Counter` to grant write access
